            0.314,
            0.682,
            0.744,
            0.821
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Following dinacharya (daily routine) and ritucharya (seasonal routine) helps maintain this balance. Eating fresh, wholesome food suited to one’s prakriti (body constitution) is essential. Regular exercise, cleanliness, restful sleep, and a calm mind support overall well-being. This can also be achieved through practices like yoga, meditation, and mindfulness."
            }
          ]
        },
